35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Transport is a huge cost variable. Also, whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits, which is a risk if people drop out.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Inland centers seem cramped, with eight people to a room and strict lights-out. However, shared sleeping is key for mixing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Public bookings are a nightmare to apply for. Also, cooking for ourselves on campus takes way too much time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Public beds are cheap, but attendance sheets show a lot of people skip away camps entirely.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,A third of us can't even get to campus by 9 AM without a hotel. And Shion is right; we need to sleep together to bond.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if people aren't attending away camps, maybe staying local is safer for the budget?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, if we stay local, we lose the bonding. The inland centers are tight, but they force interaction.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,But the paperwork for those centers is so long. I don't want us to spend all our time on forms.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm worried about the financial gap. If we go far, the transport costs are massive.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"If we stay on campus, we're just commuting. That's not a training camp.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minato, if the canteen is closed, a campus camp means we're back to cooking duty. That's inefficient.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. A dedicated facility is better, even if the rooms are small.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just don't want the organizers to be exhausted.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a balance between cost and attendance.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,We need to prioritize the club's unity.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
