60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is cheap but risky with the lottery. B is convenient but has food and commute issues. C is expensive and risky.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Option A provides the shared environment we need for mixing, despite the cramped rooms.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option B seems easiest, but the cooking duty sounds terrible. Option A's application is too much.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option B is the most financially stable. Option C's non-refundable deposit is a dealbreaker for me.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option B fails the bonding test. Option A is the best for the group's spirit.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, B is stable, but @Takumi is right about the commute. A third of members would need beds anyway.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,Option A is the logical choice for training and social cohesion.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm worried about the lottery for A. What if we don't get it?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"If we can't guarantee the cost, I can't support C.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Takumi,,Let's go with A. It's a real camp.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll vote for B to keep costs predictable and avoid the deposit risk of C.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,I'm voting A. The social benefit outweighs the room size.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote B. I can't handle the thought of that nine-page application for A.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm voting B. We can't afford another budget deficit.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting A. We need to stop the year-groups from splitting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
